-  map_size: [ 15,110,6 ]
+  # FIXED map (sliding disabled), centered at fix_map_origin → covers ±size/2.
+  # Campaign worlds are square ±12 m (gen_world.py AREA=24), so the box must reach
+  # ±14 in x AND y; the old [15,110,6] (a long y-corridor from SUPER's benchmark)
+  # only covered x∈[-7.5,7.5] → obstacles past that were unmapped (blind flight).
